WEBVTT

01:30.420 --> 01:34.940
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.210 --> 01:37.900
[Episode 28]

01:48.710 --> 01:50.039
Don't be afraid, my son.

01:53.000 --> 01:54.680
All of you are chipmunks?

01:58.430 --> 02:01.280
Are you two demon-hunting immortals?

02:02.790 --> 02:05.150
Our family has lived among humans

02:05.840 --> 02:07.640
without harming anyone.

02:09.240 --> 02:11.960
Please be merciful

02:12.560 --> 02:14.000
and spare our lives.

02:14.800 --> 02:16.930
I am Hong Ye, the Monarch of All Demons.

02:17.200 --> 02:18.240
My duty

02:18.670 --> 02:20.150
is to protect all demons.

02:23.800 --> 02:26.600
-Greetings, Demon King.
-Greetings, Demon King.

02:29.560 --> 02:31.820
I saw through your true forms last night.

02:32.360 --> 02:34.079
But I noticed your son is confused,

02:34.079 --> 02:36.480
unable to tell
whether he's human or demon.

02:36.750 --> 02:38.280
Why has he become like this?

02:38.910 --> 02:39.680
Also,

02:40.720 --> 02:42.960
why aren't you properly cultivating
in the forest?

02:42.960 --> 02:44.810
Instead, you mingle with humans,

02:44.810 --> 02:45.930
deceiving them

02:46.550 --> 02:48.010
and living dishonorably.

02:48.400 --> 02:49.600
What's your purpose?

02:51.000 --> 02:52.590
Please allow me to explain, Demon King.

02:52.590 --> 02:54.800
Originally, our family of three

02:55.360 --> 02:56.910
was, as you said,

02:57.320 --> 02:59.720
peacefully cultivating in the mountains.

02:59.840 --> 03:00.840
Ten years ago,

03:00.860 --> 03:03.910
when my wife and I returned from foraging,

03:04.080 --> 03:06.240
we found our home

03:06.240 --> 03:07.610
invaded by humans.

03:07.910 --> 03:09.630
They destroyed the mountains
and cut down trees.

03:09.630 --> 03:11.470
Unfortunately, our power was too weak

03:11.470 --> 03:13.000
to fight against them.

03:13.960 --> 03:15.760
Not only was our home destroyed,

03:15.800 --> 03:17.730
but our son was nowhere to be found.

03:18.280 --> 03:19.540
But we firmly believed

03:19.750 --> 03:21.660
that our son was still alive.

03:22.120 --> 03:22.800
So,

03:23.430 --> 03:25.160
we transformed into human form

03:25.590 --> 03:27.079
and came to the human realm

03:27.430 --> 03:28.630
to search for our son.

03:29.120 --> 03:30.470
After many years of searching,

03:30.470 --> 03:32.070
we finally found some clues.

03:33.910 --> 03:35.040
It turned out our son

03:35.829 --> 03:37.829
had been bought by a wealthy family.

03:38.180 --> 03:39.460
Their young master

03:39.480 --> 03:42.320
kept our son as a pet.

03:42.960 --> 03:45.950
[Happiness]

03:43.030 --> 03:44.690
We wanted to rescue our child,

03:44.750 --> 03:46.310
but on their courtyard walls

03:46.310 --> 03:48.170
were demon-repelling talismans

03:48.750 --> 03:50.610
that prevented us from entering.

03:51.400 --> 03:52.079
Therefore,

03:52.520 --> 03:55.240
we could only wait nearby
for an opportunity.

03:56.030 --> 03:57.030
Three years ago,

03:57.430 --> 03:58.960
that family moved away.

03:59.470 --> 04:01.520
Only then could we enter the courtyard

04:01.520 --> 04:02.470
and find our son.

04:02.710 --> 04:03.430
However,

04:04.960 --> 04:06.190
at that time,

04:07.990 --> 04:10.110
our son had lost his mind.

04:10.800 --> 04:12.470
He not only failed to
recognize his parents

04:12.470 --> 04:15.360
but considered that wealthy family
as his own.

04:15.700 --> 04:17.850
He cried every day,

04:18.040 --> 04:19.700
wanting to find his "family."

04:20.310 --> 04:22.079
We tried many methods,

04:22.190 --> 04:25.390
but our son refused to believe
he was a demon.

04:25.870 --> 04:27.870
He insisted on finding that family.

04:28.190 --> 04:29.510
We had no choice

04:29.790 --> 04:30.850
but to frighten him

04:30.870 --> 04:32.400
by saying his human parents

04:32.920 --> 04:34.050
had been eaten by us.

04:34.220 --> 04:35.420
And if he didn't obey,

04:35.680 --> 04:36.830
we would eat him too.

04:38.040 --> 04:40.470
Our son, in his confused state,

04:40.680 --> 04:41.870
is attached to the human realm

04:41.870 --> 04:44.070
and refuses to return to the mountains.

04:44.690 --> 04:46.390
But in human territory,

04:47.120 --> 04:48.240
money is a must.

04:48.240 --> 04:48.800
Yes.

04:49.190 --> 04:50.450
It was difficult for us

04:50.720 --> 04:52.040
to raise him.

04:52.800 --> 04:53.750
A couple of years ago,

04:53.750 --> 04:55.760
a family took a liking to my son

04:56.159 --> 04:58.409
and insisted on marrying
their daughter to him.

04:58.409 --> 04:59.700
But we only found out after the marriage

04:59.700 --> 05:02.110
that the girl already had a lover.

05:02.600 --> 05:04.170
Her parents didn't approve of him,

05:04.170 --> 05:06.430
so they used my son
to break up the couple.

05:06.560 --> 05:08.160
We wanted to help the couple,

05:08.810 --> 05:11.290
so we let the girl elope with her lover.

05:11.710 --> 05:14.350
We gave her family a bloodstained garment

05:14.560 --> 05:17.360
claiming she went to the mountains
to gather herbs

05:18.430 --> 05:19.760
and was eaten by a demon.

05:20.070 --> 05:21.700
The girl was grateful,

05:21.750 --> 05:23.800
so she left her dowry with us.

05:24.100 --> 05:26.300
So when you need money again,

05:26.330 --> 05:28.800
you'll just find another marriage
for your son?

05:28.800 --> 05:30.190
We only seek money,

05:30.310 --> 05:31.190
not lives.

05:31.370 --> 05:32.450
That girl, Cui,

05:32.480 --> 05:34.970
was born to a concubine
of a wealthy family.

05:35.480 --> 05:38.010
She was bullied
by her family since childhood

05:38.120 --> 05:40.790
and had long wanted to leave
and make her own way.

05:41.310 --> 05:42.400
We wanted money,

05:42.800 --> 05:44.130
and she wanted freedom.

05:45.070 --> 05:46.330
Though you're demons,

05:46.370 --> 05:47.540
you place the blame

05:47.909 --> 05:49.820
entirely on demons.

05:50.870 --> 05:52.360
Unsolved human cases

05:52.360 --> 05:54.380
are mostly blamed on demons.

05:55.510 --> 05:56.630
One more or one less

05:56.630 --> 05:57.870
doesn't make a difference.

05:57.870 --> 05:59.870
Why do you only learn the bad things?

06:03.360 --> 06:05.040
What do you plan to do in the future?

06:05.040 --> 06:06.600
Originally, our family of three

06:06.600 --> 06:08.830
lived freely cultivating in the mountains.

06:08.830 --> 06:10.600
We only resent that the humans invaded,

06:10.600 --> 06:11.950
destroyed our home,

06:12.270 --> 06:13.870
and separated our family.

06:14.630 --> 06:15.480
Now,

06:15.480 --> 06:16.680
our home is no longer a home,

06:16.680 --> 06:17.870
and we're neither human nor demon.

06:17.870 --> 06:19.800
We live in constant fear every day,

06:20.270 --> 06:22.670
afraid humans will discover we are demons.

06:23.000 --> 06:24.120
For us two old ones,

06:24.120 --> 06:25.720
our lives don't matter much.

06:25.920 --> 06:28.180
We only fear that one day when we're gone,

06:30.160 --> 06:32.360
our son will be left alone in this world,

06:32.600 --> 06:33.930
struggling to survive.

06:39.930 --> 06:44.580
[Happiness]

06:43.430 --> 06:44.159
Thank you.

06:47.190 --> 06:47.870
It seems we need to

06:47.870 --> 06:50.070
resolve his trauma as soon as possible.

06:50.270 --> 06:52.330
But my son's obsession runs too deep,

06:52.600 --> 06:53.920
how can we resolve it?

06:54.920 --> 06:56.190
Where did you find him?

06:56.280 --> 06:57.190
Take us there.

07:02.390 --> 07:03.050
Demon King.

07:04.040 --> 07:05.440
This is the Xu Residence.

08:14.950 --> 08:15.600
Tai!

08:16.120 --> 08:17.160
Tai, I'm back!

08:19.610 --> 08:20.310
Tai!

08:30.040 --> 08:30.560
Tai!

08:31.290 --> 08:32.240
Tai!

08:38.830 --> 08:39.750
Tai!

08:58.670 --> 08:59.630
Tai!

09:01.790 --> 09:02.630
Tai!

09:56.790 --> 09:57.510
Jin Jr.

09:59.050 --> 10:00.110
You must be hungry.

10:01.160 --> 10:03.890
Today my father punished me
with a day of fasting,

10:04.600 --> 10:06.470
so you didn't get any food either.

10:07.630 --> 10:10.630
These are rice grains
I picked up from under the table.

10:10.670 --> 10:11.870
Between the two of us,

10:11.910 --> 10:13.440
it can only fill one of us up.

10:14.490 --> 10:15.550
You can have it all.

10:22.750 --> 10:23.620
Today,

10:23.910 --> 10:26.510
Squire Liu
brought his newly purchased bird

10:26.790 --> 10:28.120
to show off to my father.

10:28.670 --> 10:30.480
He said that bird
could speak human language

10:30.480 --> 10:32.470
and cost him ten taels of gold.

10:33.080 --> 10:34.390
In all of Tiansheng Kingdom,

10:34.390 --> 10:35.790
there's only one like it.

10:36.240 --> 10:36.910
I said,

10:37.390 --> 10:39.960
"What's so great
about speaking human language?

10:39.960 --> 10:41.480
My Jin Jr. can do that too."

10:43.430 --> 10:45.960
With that,
Father slapped me across the face,

10:46.960 --> 10:48.000
said I was lying,

10:48.390 --> 10:49.760
and punished me with no food for a day

10:49.760 --> 10:50.890
to teach me a lesson.

10:51.710 --> 10:52.440
Jin Jr.

10:53.880 --> 10:55.680
You need to show some spirit too.

10:55.790 --> 10:57.450
Learn to speak human language

10:57.550 --> 10:59.790
and put Squire Liu's bird in its place.

11:04.930 --> 11:05.720
Jin Jr.

11:38.510 --> 11:39.200
Jin Jr.

11:40.240 --> 11:42.390
Have a candied chestnut.

11:43.620 --> 11:44.950
Jin Jr., let me tell you,

11:45.240 --> 11:46.640
these candied chestnuts

11:46.870 --> 11:49.270
are the finest delicacy
in the human realm.

11:49.360 --> 11:51.090
It's because my teacher gave me

11:51.120 --> 11:52.630
the highest grade,

11:52.630 --> 11:54.490
Mother agreed to buy these for me.

11:56.630 --> 11:57.870
We are brothers.

11:58.630 --> 12:00.150
From now on, if I have a bite,

12:00.150 --> 12:01.410
you'll have a bite too.

12:01.670 --> 12:02.930
From this day forward,

12:03.030 --> 12:04.390
it will always be like this.

12:04.390 --> 12:05.920
Here's another one for you.

12:36.890 --> 12:38.290
My dad beats me every day.

12:38.770 --> 12:40.100
I can't take it anymore.

12:40.570 --> 12:41.690
Tonight,

12:42.390 --> 12:44.320
let's run away from home together.

12:45.390 --> 12:46.240
From now on,

12:46.750 --> 12:47.910
no matter how far,

12:49.050 --> 12:50.430
it'll just be us two brothers

12:50.430 --> 12:51.630
traveling together.

12:53.240 --> 12:54.100
What do you say?

12:57.230 --> 12:58.140
You promised.

12:58.730 --> 12:59.610
I knew it.

13:00.360 --> 13:02.290
Even if everyone else abandons me,

13:03.040 --> 13:04.700
I still have you as my brother.

13:07.440 --> 13:08.150
Tai.

13:08.670 --> 13:09.550
Why aren't you sleeping,

13:09.550 --> 13:12.080
sitting on the wall
in the middle of the night?

13:25.240 --> 13:26.030
Tai...

13:27.550 --> 13:28.670
Where did you go?

13:31.240 --> 13:32.470
Didn't we agree

13:33.870 --> 13:35.480
that no matter how far,

13:36.440 --> 13:38.080
we would travel together?

13:42.030 --> 13:43.030
Demon King, look.

13:43.960 --> 13:45.560
He still remembers the cage,

13:45.790 --> 13:48.390
but doesn't know he's a chipmunk.

13:50.050 --> 13:50.910
I'm afraid

13:51.190 --> 13:53.190
we need to find his former playmate.

13:53.270 --> 13:55.670
But the house
has been empty for three years.

13:55.670 --> 13:56.200
How...

13:56.200 --> 13:57.800
are we supposed to find them?

13:59.030 --> 14:00.110
That's not difficult.

14:00.110 --> 14:00.910
I have a way.

14:02.910 --> 14:03.550
Wait here.

14:14.120 --> 14:14.840
Sir,

14:15.240 --> 14:17.040
how long has your shop been open?

14:17.240 --> 14:18.000
This shop

14:18.360 --> 14:20.340
was passed from my grandfather
to my father,

14:20.340 --> 14:21.510
and then to me.

14:21.510 --> 14:23.170
It's been three generations.

14:23.920 --> 14:24.870
So that means

14:24.870 --> 14:27.080
you know everything
about this town?

14:27.080 --> 14:28.000
Of course.

14:28.630 --> 14:30.320
I'd like to ask about something.

14:30.320 --> 14:31.670
The residence across the street—

14:31.670 --> 14:33.180
where did its owner go?

14:33.630 --> 14:34.890
Why do you want to know?

14:36.510 --> 14:37.840
We noticed the house is empty

14:37.840 --> 14:39.640
and want to rent it to open an inn.

14:39.750 --> 14:42.150
We'll be sure to support your business
when we do.

14:42.150 --> 14:42.630
Sure.

14:42.910 --> 14:45.230
The owner's surname is Xu.

14:45.460 --> 14:47.490
He was originally the prefect of Dengzhou.

14:47.490 --> 14:48.950
Due to political entanglements,

14:48.950 --> 14:50.260
he was demoted and sent here.

14:50.260 --> 14:51.490
After suffering for a few years,

14:51.490 --> 14:53.820
he was reinstated
and returned to Dengzhou.

14:53.820 --> 14:55.190
If you want to find him,

14:55.240 --> 14:57.320
go to Dengzhou
and ask about Xu Residence.

14:57.320 --> 14:58.490
Anyone will know.

14:58.670 --> 14:59.270
Thank you.

15:02.080 --> 15:03.280
Let's go to Dengzhou.

15:05.480 --> 15:07.700
I seriously doubt your claim
that you've never left the palace

15:07.700 --> 15:08.600
is true.

15:09.920 --> 15:11.450
Why would I lie to you?

15:11.650 --> 15:13.300
I have many more talents.

15:13.390 --> 15:13.850
Let's go.

15:13.850 --> 15:17.230
[Xu Residence]

15:14.910 --> 15:15.480
Congratulations!

15:15.480 --> 15:15.910
Thank you.

15:15.910 --> 15:16.750
Congratulations!

15:16.750 --> 15:17.810
Congratulations!

15:18.360 --> 15:19.220
Please come in.

15:21.390 --> 15:21.980
Please.

15:22.910 --> 15:23.770
Please come in.

15:24.000 --> 15:25.060
Congratulations!

15:25.790 --> 15:26.720
Congratulations!

15:26.720 --> 15:27.670
Thank you.

15:28.030 --> 15:28.890
Please come in.

15:29.790 --> 15:30.460
Congratulations!

15:30.460 --> 15:31.340
Please come in.

15:30.700 --> 15:32.550
[50 taels of gift cash]

15:35.120 --> 15:36.000
How festive!

15:40.630 --> 15:41.360
Congratulations!

15:41.360 --> 15:42.150
Congratulations.

15:42.150 --> 15:42.750
Thank you.

15:46.550 --> 15:47.200
Uncle Fu!

15:47.550 --> 15:48.150
Uncle Fu!

15:48.630 --> 15:49.690
Is that really you?

15:49.870 --> 15:51.200
I've finally found you.

15:51.750 --> 15:52.440
Is Tai here?

15:53.670 --> 15:55.030
My eyes aren't what they used to be.

15:55.030 --> 15:56.200
May I ask your name, Sir?

15:56.200 --> 15:56.620
I'm

15:56.720 --> 15:57.720
Jin Jr.

15:58.060 --> 15:59.260
Take a good look at me.

15:59.440 --> 15:59.910
Jin Jr.

16:00.080 --> 16:00.630
Jin...

16:02.510 --> 16:03.240
Don't you...

16:03.360 --> 16:04.440
remember me?

16:05.790 --> 16:06.360
Uncle Fu,

16:06.480 --> 16:07.510
I'm looking for Tai.

16:07.510 --> 16:08.600
I've looked for him for three years.

16:08.600 --> 16:09.330
Is he inside?

16:09.600 --> 16:10.390
Sir, sir.

16:11.270 --> 16:12.390
Please wait a moment.

16:12.390 --> 16:13.200
Wu,

16:14.360 --> 16:15.620
please look after him.

16:16.360 --> 16:16.870
Sir.

16:17.080 --> 16:18.030
Just a moment.

16:22.950 --> 16:23.750
Young master,

16:24.240 --> 16:26.300
there's a gentleman looking for you.

16:27.480 --> 16:28.030
Who is it?

16:30.140 --> 16:32.240
He knows my name

16:32.260 --> 16:34.500
and claims to be an old friend of yours.

16:35.030 --> 16:36.840
But I truly can't remember him.

16:38.320 --> 16:39.580
This is the gentleman.

16:41.960 --> 16:42.720
Tai.

16:43.840 --> 16:44.510
Tai!

16:45.440 --> 16:46.030
Tai!

16:47.190 --> 16:48.790
[Tai]

16:47.460 --> 16:48.920
I've finally found you.

16:49.710 --> 16:51.000
I missed you so much.

16:52.600 --> 16:53.360
I missed you.

17:00.780 --> 17:01.600
Sir.

17:03.330 --> 17:04.180
Have you

17:05.310 --> 17:06.970
mistaken me for someone else?

17:08.200 --> 17:10.109
It's me, Jin Jr.

17:12.030 --> 17:13.310
Don't you recognize me?

17:13.310 --> 17:15.440
We used to hang out together every day.

17:15.510 --> 17:16.960
We ate candied chestnuts

17:17.270 --> 17:18.270
and climbed trees together.

17:18.270 --> 17:19.880
Once you fell from a tree

17:20.000 --> 17:21.599
and were bedridden for days.

17:21.720 --> 17:22.720
And another time,

17:23.589 --> 17:25.550
you wanted us to run away from home,

17:26.240 --> 17:27.640
saying no matter how far,

17:28.480 --> 17:29.940
we would travel together.

17:35.590 --> 17:36.240
Sir,

17:36.880 --> 17:37.590
I don't know

17:37.590 --> 17:38.480
how you learned about

17:38.480 --> 17:40.340
these childhood stories of mine.

17:41.090 --> 17:42.790
But my father was very strict.

17:43.750 --> 17:45.480
I grew up alone in our household

17:45.560 --> 17:47.710
and never attended any private school.

17:47.710 --> 17:48.770
I had no playmates,

17:49.980 --> 17:51.240
let alone old friends.

17:52.240 --> 17:52.640
I...

17:58.530 --> 18:00.630
[Xu Residence]

18:02.060 --> 18:03.390
Today is my wedding day.

18:03.940 --> 18:05.200
You're welcome to stay

18:05.310 --> 18:06.510
and have a drink

18:06.530 --> 18:07.590
to share in our joy.

18:08.070 --> 18:08.600
Uncle Fu,

18:09.240 --> 18:09.920
please attend to our guest.

18:09.920 --> 18:10.350
Yes.

18:12.640 --> 18:13.200
Sir.

18:13.920 --> 18:15.200
Please stay for a drink.

18:15.200 --> 18:15.930
Have a drink.

19:39.680 --> 19:40.880
Now that they've met,

19:40.960 --> 19:43.760
he's experienced
the cold selfishness of humans.

19:43.810 --> 19:45.410
His obsession will dissolve

19:46.270 --> 19:47.270
and he'll return.

19:49.240 --> 19:51.170
You have so little faith in humans?

19:52.790 --> 19:54.450
Why don't we make another bet?

19:54.510 --> 19:55.880
You lost the last round

19:55.880 --> 19:57.610
and haven't paid your debt yet.

19:58.270 --> 19:59.790
I found the bride first.

20:01.680 --> 20:03.510
At best it was a tie.

20:05.510 --> 20:06.030
Fine.

20:06.920 --> 20:08.520
Let's make another bet then.

20:09.170 --> 20:10.570
This time, let's bet that

20:10.830 --> 20:12.690
true feelings won't be betrayed.

20:13.310 --> 20:14.310
What's the stake?

20:14.350 --> 20:15.210
Same as before.

20:15.720 --> 20:16.450
You're back.

20:24.110 --> 20:24.640
Yes.

20:39.030 --> 20:39.830
You saw him?

20:42.960 --> 20:44.160
It's good you saw him.

20:44.270 --> 20:45.880
At least your wish is fulfilled.

20:45.880 --> 20:46.510
From now on,

20:46.510 --> 20:48.570
come home with us and live a good life.

20:49.000 --> 20:49.590
Let's go.

20:53.230 --> 20:55.030
All that talk about brotherhood

20:56.480 --> 20:58.310
was just empty words.

20:59.550 --> 21:01.000
In humans' eyes,

21:02.000 --> 21:03.110
I'm just

21:04.570 --> 21:07.130
a pet to pass their boring time.

21:11.880 --> 21:12.680
It's over.

21:13.240 --> 21:14.550
Don't think about it anymore.

21:14.550 --> 21:15.310
Let's go.

21:15.310 --> 21:15.840
Let's go.

21:23.590 --> 21:24.070
Come.

21:24.590 --> 21:25.440
Careful.

21:43.440 --> 21:45.580
You wanted us to run away from home,

21:46.090 --> 21:47.780
saying no matter how far,

21:48.030 --> 21:49.490
we would travel together.

21:50.880 --> 21:51.830
Tonight,

21:52.510 --> 21:54.710
we'll escape from this house together.

21:55.000 --> 21:55.720
From now on,

21:56.290 --> 21:57.490
no matter how far,

21:58.670 --> 22:01.470
it'll just be us two brothers
traveling together.

22:01.920 --> 22:02.780
What do you say?

22:05.310 --> 22:06.070
Jin Jr...

22:21.310 --> 22:22.160
Jin Jr.

22:23.350 --> 22:24.680
Your parents, for your sake,

22:24.680 --> 22:26.010
lived in constant fear,

22:26.070 --> 22:28.510
hiding among humans for the past decade,

22:28.550 --> 22:30.610
risking their lives at every moment.

22:31.070 --> 22:33.120
If they hadn't protected you
with all their might,

22:33.120 --> 22:35.270
you wouldn't have survived till today.

22:35.270 --> 22:36.800
These years of protection—

22:36.810 --> 22:39.140
doesn't that deserve a thank you from you?

22:44.270 --> 22:45.870
Dad and Mom,

22:46.890 --> 22:48.950
I've put you in a difficult position.

22:49.270 --> 22:49.990
Thank you.

22:51.270 --> 22:52.140
All right,

22:52.720 --> 22:53.980
let's not be so formal.

22:54.830 --> 22:55.970
It's only natural

22:56.270 --> 22:57.590
that we protect you.

22:58.350 --> 23:00.190
You have such loving parents.

23:00.220 --> 23:01.680
You should treasure them.

23:10.000 --> 23:10.760
From now on,

23:11.150 --> 23:13.480
the Princess will also be well protected.

23:20.360 --> 23:21.560
Protected by whom?

23:22.590 --> 23:23.270
Who?

23:23.640 --> 23:24.510
Where?

23:30.080 --> 23:32.150
If I truly had someone to rely on,

23:32.150 --> 23:34.030
I might become quite spoiled.

23:34.480 --> 23:37.030
That person better not regret it later.

23:38.270 --> 23:39.800
If I am to be your protector,

23:39.880 --> 23:40.740
I can handle it,

23:42.000 --> 23:43.200
and I will excel at it.

23:47.590 --> 23:48.400
Jin Jr.!

23:49.510 --> 23:50.310
Jin Jr.!

23:55.240 --> 23:55.920
Jin Jr.!

23:56.270 --> 23:57.070
Jin Jr.!

23:57.270 --> 23:58.070
Jin Jr.!

24:00.000 --> 24:00.930
Jin Jr.!

24:08.070 --> 24:08.890
Jin Jr.!

24:09.960 --> 24:11.760
Quick, follow the young master.

24:11.790 --> 24:13.050
Wait up, young master.

24:13.110 --> 24:14.130
I remember now!

24:15.200 --> 24:16.790
I haven't forgotten you, Jin Jr.!

24:16.790 --> 24:18.390
I've always remembered you!

24:29.920 --> 24:30.950
Jin Jr.!

24:33.030 --> 24:34.240
Thank you!

24:35.550 --> 24:37.700
For accompanying me through my youth.

24:40.310 --> 24:41.370
The day I went home,

24:42.320 --> 24:44.380
I opened the cage to set you free.

24:45.160 --> 24:47.220
No matter how I tried to shoo you away,

24:47.890 --> 24:49.210
you refused to leave.

24:50.730 --> 24:52.730
My father wouldn't let me bring you.

24:53.570 --> 24:55.500
I had no choice but to fill your cage

24:56.200 --> 24:58.200
with nuts and chestnuts.

24:59.440 --> 25:01.370
I hoped that after finishing them,

25:01.830 --> 25:04.290
you would venture out
to find food yourself.

25:04.680 --> 25:06.070
But I never expected

25:07.250 --> 25:08.780
that after all these years,

25:09.590 --> 25:11.510
you'd still be searching for me.

25:14.480 --> 25:15.480
Jin Jr.,

25:16.480 --> 25:19.230
you will always be my best brother!

25:20.240 --> 25:21.830
No matter how far,

25:23.000 --> 25:24.700
I am willing

25:24.960 --> 25:26.720
to travel with you!

26:14.830 --> 26:16.230
No matter how far,

26:19.310 --> 26:20.900
I will never forget you.

26:28.920 --> 26:30.850
Their ending was decided long ago.

26:31.590 --> 26:33.050
The human and demon realms

26:33.070 --> 26:34.110
living in peace

26:35.000 --> 26:36.530
is the best ending for them.

26:39.250 --> 26:40.550
So who wins this round?

26:42.070 --> 26:42.640
You win.

26:45.510 --> 26:46.000
Tell me,

26:46.350 --> 26:47.680
what do you want me to do?

26:49.920 --> 26:51.070
I haven't decided yet.

26:51.070 --> 26:52.720
I'll tell you when I figure it out.

26:52.720 --> 26:53.580
Take your time.

26:55.640 --> 26:56.240
Jin Jr.

27:00.680 --> 27:02.540
Do you have any attachments left?

27:02.880 --> 27:04.410
My wish has been fulfilled.

27:05.790 --> 27:06.640
In this life,

27:08.160 --> 27:09.890
I only wish to serve my parents.

27:14.920 --> 27:15.980
If that's the case,

27:16.480 --> 27:18.240
shall I take you to Demons' Valley?

27:18.240 --> 27:19.170
Demons' Valley?

27:19.920 --> 27:21.650
The legendary Demons' Valley?

27:22.750 --> 27:24.480
Does such a place really exist?

27:24.590 --> 27:26.520
You'll find out when you get there.

27:35.300 --> 27:36.770
The mountains and lakes here

27:36.770 --> 27:38.440
are all protected by barriers.

27:38.440 --> 27:40.570
Humans aren't able to find this place.

27:42.350 --> 27:43.550
Demons from all regions

27:43.550 --> 27:44.610
have gathered here

27:44.790 --> 27:46.440
and live in peace with each other.

27:46.440 --> 27:47.960
You can find a quiet place

27:48.270 --> 27:49.530
for your cultivation.

27:49.550 --> 27:50.680
If you need anything,

27:50.680 --> 27:52.280
come find me at Youning Cave.

27:54.590 --> 27:55.850
Thank you, Demon King.

27:58.110 --> 27:58.830
Let's go.

28:05.700 --> 28:06.320
Ning'an.

28:10.100 --> 28:11.470
A hundred years ago...

28:11.790 --> 28:13.110
Except for those two bridges,

28:13.110 --> 28:15.080
nothing changed here.

28:15.400 --> 28:17.060
Your development is too slow.

28:19.060 --> 28:20.190
You recognize them?

28:21.820 --> 28:22.680
The Zhuyu herb.

28:26.590 --> 28:27.720
You know quite a lot.

28:29.350 --> 28:30.790
They are spirit herbs from Mount Zhaoyao

28:30.790 --> 28:32.650
that have achieved cultivation.

28:32.750 --> 28:33.920
These spirit herbs
have miraculous effects.

28:33.920 --> 28:35.190
If humans eat them,

28:35.270 --> 28:37.350
they can go without food for seven days.

28:37.350 --> 28:38.960
That's why in human territories,

28:38.960 --> 28:41.290
they've been eaten almost to extinction.

28:41.310 --> 28:43.070
Fortunately, the Demon King was generous

28:43.070 --> 28:45.030
and helped relocate them
to Demons' Valley,

28:45.030 --> 28:47.570
allowing them to survive until today.

28:48.070 --> 28:49.480
Am I right, My Lord?

28:50.790 --> 28:52.190
How did you know all this?

28:53.270 --> 28:54.130
From my dreams.

28:55.640 --> 28:56.310
Tell me,

28:57.830 --> 29:00.200
how many times have you dreamed about me?

29:03.270 --> 29:04.720
Many times.

29:08.620 --> 29:11.510
For a demon, the path of cultivation
is exceptionally difficult.

29:11.510 --> 29:13.110
One must possess innate wisdom,

29:13.110 --> 29:15.240
draw upon the essence
of heaven and earth,

29:15.240 --> 29:17.240
follow the laws of nature's cycles,

29:17.550 --> 29:19.810
and endure countless seasons and moons—

29:19.830 --> 29:21.690
only then may one take human form.

29:21.750 --> 29:22.530
Meanwhile,

29:22.790 --> 29:24.390
they must also evade pursuit

29:24.440 --> 29:26.440
from both humans and their own kind.

29:34.310 --> 29:35.790
How do bamboos fare here?

29:36.510 --> 29:37.250
Bamboos?

29:37.640 --> 29:38.070
Yes.

29:38.400 --> 29:39.310
Didn't you say

29:39.310 --> 29:40.510
all things possess innate wisdom

29:40.510 --> 29:42.220
and can achieve human form?

29:42.790 --> 29:44.750
I have lived for thousands of years,

29:44.750 --> 29:47.750
but have never seen a bamboo
successfully cultivate.

29:50.270 --> 29:51.680
So you're the first

29:51.680 --> 29:53.340
bamboo to achieve human form.

29:53.960 --> 29:55.480
No wonder you're so proud.

29:57.310 --> 29:58.750
Cultivation is difficult,

29:58.750 --> 29:59.680
so I'll be generous

29:59.680 --> 30:00.540
and not eat you.

30:02.200 --> 30:03.030
Those three

30:03.830 --> 30:06.160
were mythical beasts from ancient times.

30:06.310 --> 30:08.310
They died in the war against humans.

30:09.000 --> 30:10.310
To commemorate them,

30:10.790 --> 30:12.120
the demons carved

30:12.310 --> 30:13.970
their images on the mountain.

30:14.400 --> 30:16.720
Teng She, Ao Hen, and Qiong Qi.

30:19.830 --> 30:22.090
Is there anything else you haven't seen?

30:22.480 --> 30:23.110
Yes,

30:23.480 --> 30:24.240
quite a lot.

30:24.790 --> 30:26.790
Take me to meet your demon subjects.

30:27.440 --> 30:28.160
Bi Fang

30:28.590 --> 30:30.850
is shaped like a crane
with a single foot;

30:31.200 --> 30:32.350
it has a red-patterned teal body

30:32.350 --> 30:34.880
-with a white beak.
-Through the water curtain

30:34.880 --> 30:36.160
is the Demons' Valley Academy.

30:36.160 --> 30:37.360
-It's called...
-It's called the Moon-Gazing Terrace.

30:37.360 --> 30:38.550
Bi Fang.

30:39.070 --> 30:41.160
Its call is its own name.

30:41.640 --> 30:43.200
Who among you knows

30:43.310 --> 30:47.070
what Bi Fang's true form is?

30:49.750 --> 30:50.510
Xiao Yao,

30:51.000 --> 30:52.360
you answer.

30:57.590 --> 30:58.830
Wait, wait.

30:59.370 --> 31:00.730
Sir, let me think.

31:02.610 --> 31:04.540
It looks like a crane with one foot.

31:04.590 --> 31:06.750
It looks like a crane with one foot!

31:06.880 --> 31:08.070
And...

31:08.400 --> 31:10.000
Wait a moment, wait a moment.

31:11.400 --> 31:12.060
Delicious.

31:12.270 --> 31:13.270
Wait, wait.

31:14.310 --> 31:15.720
What's going on? I can't find it.

31:15.720 --> 31:16.440
Dali!

31:18.000 --> 31:18.880
Dali!

31:18.990 --> 31:22.260
-Wait.
-Red-patterned teal body with white beak.

31:23.200 --> 31:23.880
Red—

31:28.830 --> 31:30.110
If there's a next time,

31:30.440 --> 31:32.920
I will banish you
from Moon-Gazing Terrace.

31:33.550 --> 31:35.150
Recite it 30 times together,

31:35.160 --> 31:36.890
then I'll continue the lesson.

31:40.920 --> 31:43.310
I used to hate the Master's nagging,

31:43.830 --> 31:45.830
but after being away
from class for so long,

31:45.830 --> 31:47.240
I actually miss it.

31:48.270 --> 31:49.400
The academy in Demons' Valley

31:49.400 --> 31:51.660
is quite different from those of humans.

31:52.610 --> 31:53.980
Quickly raise the water curtain

31:53.980 --> 31:55.580
and take me closer for a look.

31:55.920 --> 31:57.000
Then stay behind me

31:57.160 --> 31:59.490
and don't let them discover you're human.

31:59.640 --> 32:01.220
I'm a little snake.

32:01.270 --> 32:02.110
I just shed my skin.

32:02.110 --> 32:03.200
His Lordship discovered me

32:03.200 --> 32:04.370
and brought me back to Demons' Valley

32:04.370 --> 32:05.960
to learn demon knowledge.

32:06.160 --> 32:06.750
My Lord,

32:06.750 --> 32:07.880
have you forgotten?

32:08.200 --> 32:08.640
No.

32:12.830 --> 32:14.160
Do you understand?

32:18.790 --> 32:19.440
My Lord.

32:29.640 --> 32:31.440
Greetings, My Lord.

32:32.350 --> 32:34.080
This is the academy's teacher,

32:34.360 --> 32:35.560
King of Eight Plates.

32:36.230 --> 32:37.010
Hello, Sir.

32:37.850 --> 32:40.110
I really want to hear your lessons again.

32:41.110 --> 32:42.910
I promise I won't get distracted

32:43.160 --> 32:44.360
or daydream anymore.

32:45.680 --> 32:47.060
If you want to learn,

32:47.400 --> 32:49.480
you can start anytime.

32:50.310 --> 32:51.890
Having a student like you

32:52.200 --> 32:54.310
makes me very pleased.

32:55.270 --> 32:57.310
This is her first time
in Demons' Valley today.

32:57.310 --> 32:58.840
I'll show her around first.

32:59.070 --> 33:00.930
Please continue with your class.

33:24.750 --> 33:25.860
Your coming to Demons' Valley

33:25.860 --> 33:27.540
is as if you're returning home—

33:27.540 --> 33:29.470
you're familiar with everything.

33:36.350 --> 33:37.750
Where did this come from?

33:37.780 --> 33:39.160
I weaved it for fun.

33:42.960 --> 33:43.560
Xiao Ming.

33:43.960 --> 33:44.760
Don't be rude.

33:47.110 --> 33:48.030
Don't be afraid.

33:48.030 --> 33:49.510
He's a little cat I adopted.

33:49.510 --> 33:50.000
Okay.

33:54.440 --> 33:55.040
Xiao Ming.

33:55.740 --> 33:56.870
Let me ask her first.

33:58.310 --> 33:59.000
Who are you?

34:00.110 --> 34:00.880
She...

34:01.400 --> 34:03.910
She wandered in the human realm
for many years

34:03.910 --> 34:05.640
and I just happened to find her.

34:06.960 --> 34:08.020
Are you a demon too?

34:08.150 --> 34:09.210
I'm a little snake.

34:09.610 --> 34:10.409
That's right.

34:11.030 --> 34:12.560
Then where are your scales?

34:12.590 --> 34:13.250
I shed them.

34:14.000 --> 34:14.400
Shed?

34:14.400 --> 34:14.760
Yeah.

34:17.010 --> 34:18.070
Snakes eat mice.

34:18.230 --> 34:19.560
Eat one to prove it to me.

34:19.800 --> 34:20.480
Why should I?

34:20.480 --> 34:21.400
That's not necessary.

34:21.400 --> 34:21.920
But...

34:22.510 --> 34:23.000
But...

34:23.400 --> 34:25.260
But My Lord, her scent is strange.

34:25.480 --> 34:26.800
What scent could she possibly have?

34:26.800 --> 34:29.280
Are you always this rude?

34:29.280 --> 34:30.800
When was I ever rude?

34:30.800 --> 34:32.800
-My Lord.
-You're the one who's odd.

34:32.840 --> 34:33.320
Do you see...

34:33.320 --> 34:33.800
Back up.

34:38.880 --> 34:39.710
Don't be afraid.

34:39.710 --> 34:40.070
Come.

34:40.280 --> 34:40.630
Okay.

34:47.190 --> 34:49.120
This is where
I usually cultivate.

34:49.440 --> 34:50.840
You can rest here for now.

34:51.280 --> 34:52.400
Let me tell you something.

34:52.400 --> 34:54.110
You'd better not make me angry.

34:54.110 --> 34:55.000
My Lord.

34:55.150 --> 34:55.790
Xiao Mu.

34:56.070 --> 34:58.110
Why are you being so disrespectful today?

34:58.110 --> 34:58.960
My Lord.

34:59.230 --> 34:59.670
I...

35:02.360 --> 35:02.920
Xiao Mu.

35:03.710 --> 35:05.370
Let me have a close look at her.

35:13.190 --> 35:14.360
My Lord.

35:14.590 --> 35:17.190
Xiao Mu is actually looking out
for your best interests.

35:17.190 --> 35:19.190
You've been away from Demons' Valley
for so long.

35:19.190 --> 35:21.110
Heiwu has been spreading rumors
about you everywhere,

35:21.110 --> 35:23.550
saying your going to the human realm
to search for demon treasures

35:23.550 --> 35:24.680
is just an excuse.

35:24.800 --> 35:27.110
The truth is, you have
an intimate relationship with humans,

35:27.110 --> 35:29.070
and that you keep showing goodwill
to humans.

35:29.070 --> 35:31.210
It's been making everyone anxious.

35:31.440 --> 35:32.630
We just hope

35:33.190 --> 35:34.800
that you'll be more careful.

35:35.480 --> 35:37.590
Don't give him any ammunition against you.

35:37.590 --> 35:38.120
Huh?

35:38.360 --> 35:40.890
Heiwu has been like that
since centuries ago?

35:42.400 --> 35:44.150
-You know Heiwu?
-You know Heiwu?

35:44.150 --> 35:45.150
He's a nightmare.

35:46.230 --> 35:47.890
Never mind about nightmares.

35:48.070 --> 35:50.230
Humans are hunting demons everywhere now.

35:50.230 --> 35:51.110
Heiwu led some demons

35:51.110 --> 35:52.480
and killed quite a few humans too.

35:52.480 --> 35:52.940
Just now

35:53.030 --> 35:54.710
he brought a pile of "trophies."

35:54.710 --> 35:56.710
Now he's in front
of the elders at Youning Cave

35:56.710 --> 35:57.920
seeking credit for his deeds.

35:57.920 --> 35:59.070
Whenever he gets a chance,

35:59.070 --> 36:00.530
he tries to discredit you.

36:00.590 --> 36:01.840
What we mean is,

36:01.840 --> 36:03.250
since you've returned, My Lord,

36:03.250 --> 36:05.280
you should quickly go to Youning Cave
and show yourself

36:05.280 --> 36:06.630
to prove your innocence.

36:06.630 --> 36:07.840
Why didn't you say that earlier?

36:07.840 --> 36:08.800
What do you mean?

36:08.800 --> 36:10.360
-I've said so much—
-Forget it.

36:10.360 --> 36:11.630
I happen to have important matters

36:11.630 --> 36:13.110
to discuss with the elders.

36:13.110 --> 36:14.670
I shall meet with Heiwu while I'm there.

36:14.670 --> 36:15.030
Yes.

36:16.670 --> 36:17.600
Wait for me here.

36:17.670 --> 36:18.480
Don't wander off.

36:18.480 --> 36:21.080
Not every demon
in Demons' Valley is friendly.

36:21.770 --> 36:22.370
Xiao Ming.

36:22.800 --> 36:24.260
Take good care of Ning'an.

36:26.190 --> 36:27.250
Wait for my return.

36:27.440 --> 36:27.920
Okay.

36:28.510 --> 36:29.710
Don't worry, My Lord.

36:29.710 --> 36:31.240
I'll keep a close eye on her.

36:33.840 --> 36:34.880
I'll watch her.

36:38.110 --> 36:39.320
I'll take care of her.

36:43.190 --> 36:44.190
My Lord!

36:47.200 --> 36:48.530
Don't worry, it's fine.

36:53.880 --> 36:54.740
This is for you.

36:55.490 --> 36:57.250
It's a welcome gift.

37:00.400 --> 37:00.760
Hey!

37:00.760 --> 37:01.630
Let me tell you.

37:01.920 --> 37:03.630
Don't try to fool me with things

37:03.630 --> 37:04.670
that only work on minor demons.

37:04.670 --> 37:06.640
You're clearly cunning.

37:08.550 --> 37:10.030
Acting all sweet in front of His Lordship.

37:10.030 --> 37:11.560
I can see right through you.

37:11.770 --> 37:13.900
You can be really annoying sometimes.

37:13.960 --> 37:14.280
I...

37:14.280 --> 37:14.920
But

37:14.920 --> 37:16.380
you're also the most loyal

37:16.440 --> 37:18.970
and devoted to His Lordship
among all demons.

37:19.510 --> 37:20.440
So

37:21.920 --> 37:24.200
I do like you a little bit.

37:28.150 --> 37:29.230
Of course.

37:30.320 --> 37:31.180
Let me tell you,

37:31.550 --> 37:33.280
in the whole of Demons' Valley,

37:33.480 --> 37:35.440
when it comes to loyalty to His Lordship,

37:35.440 --> 37:36.760
I, Xiao Ming, rank first,

37:36.760 --> 37:38.820
and Xiao Mu only dares to rank second.

37:40.510 --> 37:41.150
If you don't believe me,

37:41.150 --> 37:42.670
I'll let Xiao Mu come out and tell you.

37:42.670 --> 37:43.480
No, no.

37:43.480 --> 37:44.210
Don't fight.

37:44.320 --> 37:45.360
I believe you.

37:51.280 --> 37:53.400
Why do you share one body?

37:54.070 --> 37:55.760
Which one of you is older

37:55.760 --> 37:56.960
and which is younger?

37:59.290 --> 38:01.350
I'm not quite sure about that either.

38:02.280 --> 38:03.800
All I know is that

38:04.430 --> 38:05.840
including us,

38:05.840 --> 38:07.170
we were nine siblings.

38:07.840 --> 38:10.000
We all cultivated together originally.

38:10.000 --> 38:11.230
But by the end,

38:11.230 --> 38:12.920
only Xiao Mu and I remained.

38:13.550 --> 38:15.320
And before we achieved human form,

38:15.320 --> 38:17.920
we went through
a major heavenly tribulation.

38:18.030 --> 38:20.030
Xiao Mu lost his life protecting me.

38:20.280 --> 38:22.590
I barely managed to catch Xiao Mu's soul

38:22.590 --> 38:23.990
to share my body with him.

38:24.590 --> 38:25.930
But as you know,

38:26.070 --> 38:27.600
having two souls in one body

38:27.670 --> 38:29.670
always causes power disturbances.

38:29.710 --> 38:31.110
We nearly lost our lives.

38:31.400 --> 38:33.280
Fortunately, His Lordship appeared in time

38:33.280 --> 38:34.760
and brought us back to Demons' Valley.

38:34.760 --> 38:36.580
He taught us methods of cultivation,

38:36.580 --> 38:38.320
allowing us to stabilize our minds

38:38.320 --> 38:39.320
up until today.

38:39.840 --> 38:41.040
So ever since then,

38:41.110 --> 38:42.440
Xiao Ming is Xiao Mu,

38:42.440 --> 38:43.920
and Xiao Mu is Xiao Ming.

38:43.960 --> 38:45.230
We are inseparable.

38:46.960 --> 38:49.480
No wonder you're so loyal and devoted.

38:52.670 --> 38:53.800
Of course.

38:54.950 --> 38:55.610
Have a seat.

38:57.150 --> 38:58.840
But there's one thing

38:58.840 --> 39:00.180
I must admit.

39:00.760 --> 39:01.490
The truth is,

39:01.660 --> 39:05.000
Xiao Mu and I had very weak powers.

39:05.230 --> 39:05.760
And

39:06.770 --> 39:10.140
Xiao Mu can be quite sharp-tongued.

39:11.940 --> 39:13.870
So many great demons

39:13.890 --> 39:15.110
disliked us both

39:15.110 --> 39:16.630
and bullied us constantly.

39:16.630 --> 39:17.730
Only His Lordship

39:17.840 --> 39:19.150
never abandoned us

39:19.150 --> 39:20.150
and treated us with such favor.

39:20.150 --> 39:21.440
So since then,

39:21.440 --> 39:22.580
Xiao Mu and I decided

39:22.880 --> 39:24.710
to cultivate day and night

39:24.920 --> 39:26.520
to make our powers stronger,

39:26.590 --> 39:27.510
even stronger.

39:28.070 --> 39:28.550
Only this way

39:28.550 --> 39:30.110
can we be helpful to His Lordship

39:30.110 --> 39:31.440
and not bring him shame.

39:32.880 --> 39:35.140
You are His Lordship's best companions.

39:36.550 --> 39:37.520
One day,

39:37.630 --> 39:39.630
when His Lordship faces hardships,

39:39.890 --> 39:41.430
only you will protect him.

39:42.120 --> 39:43.920
Are you serious?

39:44.440 --> 39:45.760
It's His Lordship.

39:46.150 --> 39:48.190
No one among demons
or humans is his match.

39:48.190 --> 39:50.850
How could it possibly
be our turn to protect him?

39:54.280 --> 39:55.080
That's right.

39:55.720 --> 39:57.510
I hope that day never comes.

39:57.710 --> 39:58.550
Duh.

40:01.630 --> 40:03.360
Elders, you have to believe me.

40:03.360 --> 40:05.360
This is exactly what Hong Ye is like.

40:12.180 --> 40:13.470
My Lord has returned.

40:13.960 --> 40:15.670
My Lord, who has been working tirelessly
for the demons,

40:15.670 --> 40:16.930
has finally returned.

40:20.510 --> 40:21.320
This time,

40:22.640 --> 40:23.960
what sacred demon relic have you

40:23.960 --> 40:24.920
brought back for us?
